   "src": "Core · Orders of growth",
   "core": true,
   "q": "<p>Order these from highest to lowest order of growth: (a) <span class=\"math\">2<sup>n</sup></span>, (b) <span class=\"math\">n!</span>, (c) <span class=\"math\">n<sup>100</sup></span>.</p>",
